{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"cannon_rammer","model_identifier":"cannon_rammer","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## cannon_rammer\n\nCrew prop for the field cannons (reload).\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.8..1.8, y -1.8..1.8, z -44.0..22.5 (size 3.5 x 3.5 x 66.5 u = 10 x 10 x 187 cm).\nCannon rammer (1.9 m = 66.5 u): an ash staff with a turned oak rammer head forward (-Z) and a sheepskin sponge on the butt. Grip at the origin (right hand, slot_hand_r) 18 u from the sponge end; second grip (left hand) 14 u forward of it (-Z) for the ram stroke. Head reaches 44 u forward: from `slot_crew_1` it enters the muzzle 40 u ahead.\n"},"description":"## cannon_rammer\n\nCrew prop for the field cannons (reload).\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.8..1.8, y -1.8..1.8, z -44.0..22.5 (size 3.5 x 3.5 x 66.5 u = 10 x 10 x 187 cm).\nCannon rammer (1.9 m = 66.5 u): an ash staff with a turned oak rammer head forward (-Z) and a sheepskin sponge on the butt. Grip at the origin (right hand, slot_hand_r) 18 u from the sponge end; second grip (left hand) 14 u forward of it (-Z) for the ram stroke. Head reaches 44 u forward: from `slot_crew_1` it enters the muzzle 40 u ahead.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"staff","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.6,-0.6,-40.0],"to":[0.6,0.6,18.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[58,60,59.2,61.2],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,58,58.0,59.2],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[60,60,61.2,61.2],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,60,58.0,61.2],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1.2,58.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[2,0,3.2,58.0],"texture":0